    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aberrant Feedback: </strong>@Compendium[pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-spells.SfAkXA3XDi3btTlx]{Aberrant Feedback}</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> The strain of bending your dragonmark to replicate a specific spell is so great, that you can only cast this spell once per 24 hours - even if you have focus points to cast it with.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Drawing on the violent powers of your mark, you may bring down destructive potential not seen since the days of the War of the Mark. You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells.wLIvH0AT1u7oa64N]{Cataclysm}.</p>"
    },
